WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.001
All right.

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:02.836
Let's go home.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:14.472
Hey, co-pilot, see that
radar scope in front of you?

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:15.306
Yeah.

00:00:15.306 --> 00:00:16.516
That thing starts
blipping, it means

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.767
the device has lured a titan

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:20.186
that'll open the rift,
and that's our way home.

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:21.229
But how do we take off?

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:22.063
Just hang on.

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:23.898
I think you'll know
it when you feel it.

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:26.109
Just holler when
it hits 3,000 feet.

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:27.444
I'll shut the device off.

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:28.987
The titan's retreat
will pull us in.

00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:39.789
Lee, what is it?

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:40.665
What do you see?

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:42.292
Ah, sh*t.

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:44.335
We lured a titan that
was already here.

